LS
==

List files and folders.


BASIC
-----
ls

Shows files in current directory.


OPTIONS
-------
Detailed view:
  ls -l

Show hidden files:
  ls -a

Both combined:
  ls -la

Human readable sizes:
  ls -lh


WHAT YOU SEE
------------
-rw-r--r--   File permissions
1            Number of links
user         Owner
group        Group
1234         Size in bytes
Jan 1 12:00  Last modified
file.txt     Name


COLORS
------
Blue    = Directory
White   = File
Green   = Executable
Red     = Archive
